/**
 * TrustOS Messenger Mini App — console screens.
 *
 * One declaration per resource, read by the table, the filters, the search box and the
 * permission checks. The recurring admin-console bug is a field added to the form and forgotten
 * in the table; it cannot happen when there is one list.
